-10-20T20:16:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.8.dev.custom_build [c016f2200]\n- Not reproducible in v4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - macOS Unknown (27.0.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M4 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSeems to be different than #110707 (at least the initial post), as this specifically has to do with the size of each jump in a list when scrolling and also happens since some point in 4.8.\n\nWhen using an MX Master 3S mouse on macOS, scrolling is extremely sensitive and moves a long distance for even a single \"click\" on the wheel.\n\nScrolling 5 \"clicks\" in the Project Manager in 4.7.2 (reasonable):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c2cdc48-ec1e-4d30-83f1-7c2a1f37953a\n\nScrolling 5 \"clicks\" in the Project Manager in current 4.8 (way too much):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ee4d452-7648-43ed-896d-a7851dbad963\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the Project Manager and scroll through the list using a mouse wheel. The list will move very quickly.\n\nIn previous versions of Godot (or at least 4.7.2) the list should scroll at a much more reasonable rate.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124196/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124196/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_r